{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4af86587eb0dff290b2d231e1d76667","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We just got back from our destination wedding at the NOW Larimar in Punta Cana. &amp;nbsp;We hired HDC photo because of the positive reviews from this website. &amp;nbsp;We had Martin for our wedding day and Milan for the next day TTD. &amp;nbsp;We had a lot of fun the day of the wedding and Martin&#039;s personality fit that day. &amp;nbsp;He was fun, personal and we didn&#039;t even notice he was there for some of the pic&#039;s which is what we liked. &amp;nbsp;He just buzzed around like a little butterfly and got beautiful pics. &amp;nbsp;We had Milan the next day for our TTD and unfortunately my husband was very ill we suspect from the food at out resort. &amp;nbsp;We both were not feeling up to par and was an inch away from canceling but Milan was very professional and worked quickly with us. &amp;nbsp;He was very specific and told us exactly what to do. We loved our pictures and I would definitely recommend HDC photo. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1689424,"PostDate":1353892909,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We just got back from our destination wedding at the NOW Larimar in Punta Cana. \u00a0We hired HDC photo because of the positive reviews from this website. \u00a0We had Martin for our wedding day and Milan for the next day TTD. \u00a0We had a lot of fun the day of the wedding and Martin's personality fit that day. \u00a0He was fun, personal and we didn't even notice he was there for some of the pic's which is what we liked. \u00a0He just buzzed around like a little butterfly and got beautiful pics. \u00a0We had Milan the next day for our TTD and unfortunately my husband was very ill we suspect from the food at out resort. \u00a0We both were not feeling up to par and was an inch away from canceling but Milan was very professional and worked quickly with us. \u00a0He was very specific and told us exactly what to do. We loved our pictures and I would definitely recommend HDC photo. \u00a0<\/p>  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberlynae2@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1342289718,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257858.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Alynae2","Id":257858,"Name":"Alynae2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28425a299921421296ee87465a736c64","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We just returned home from our November 17th wedding at Dreams Punta Cana Resort. After reading many, many reviews we decided to go with HDC photo for our wedding. It was the best decision we could have made! Our pictures are amazing! Arnaud and Carlos were very professional and friendly. Carlos was just awesome as he came up with some really cool ideas for our&amp;nbsp;pictures. Arnaud had the proofs ready for us to view 24 hours later and the next day we had all of our prints and DVD Slideshow. I am just so happy how wonderful they turned out. I would absolutely recommend HDC to anyone and everyone!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sincerely,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Liz and Charlie&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1689859,"PostDate":1354028978,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello,<\/p> <p> We just returned home from our November 17th wedding at Dreams Punta Cana Resort. After reading many, many reviews we decided to go with HDC photo for our wedding. It was the best decision we could have made! Our pictures are amazing! Arnaud and Carlos were very professional and friendly. Carlos was just awesome as he came up with some really cool ideas for our\u00a0pictures. Arnaud had the proofs ready for us to view 24 hours later and the next day we had all of our prints and DVD Slideshow. I am just so happy how wonderful they turned out. I would absolutely recommend HDC to anyone and everyone!<\/p> <p> Sincerely,<\/p> <p> Liz and Charlie<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lizestevez@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1326060408,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249572.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lizzie111712","Id":249572,"Name":"Lizzie111712","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d195864e35efcb45234649f1fac14c29","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_615\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;HDC shot our wedding last week in Punta Cana and I can honestly tell you that it was the best decision we made for our wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_614\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;The pictures truly portrayed how the day felt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_613\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;Charlie, our photographer was patient with all of our guests and knew exactly what he was doing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_572\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;Our wedding was in the evening so we thought the pictures would be really dark on the beach but somehow, Charlie was able to pull the most amazing colours from the sky and sand.&amp;nbsp; The pictures are unbelievable - something you would see in a magazine!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_612\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;Their prompt service is excellent and appreciated especially when we had to fly home on the Saturday after the wedding.&amp;nbsp; Arnaud had all the pictures ready a couple of days later for us to select from and then the package was delivered the same evening at the front desk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;The whole process was stress free and worth every dollar!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_575\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;If you choose HDC, you will definitely not be disappointed!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_611\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_604\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;The Happy Couple,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_605\"&gt; &lt;span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\"&gt;Lillian and Ravi&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;!-- google_ad_section_end --&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1690900,"PostDate":1354285078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">\u00a0 <\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_615\"> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">HDC shot our wedding last week in Punta Cana and I can honestly tell you that it was the best decision we made for our wedding.\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_614\"> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">The pictures truly portrayed how the day felt.\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_613\"> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">Charlie, our photographer was patient with all of our guests and knew exactly what he was doing.\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_572\"> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">Our wedding was in the evening so we thought the pictures would be really dark on the beach but somehow, Charlie was able to pull the most amazing colours from the sky and sand.\u00a0 The pictures are unbelievable - something you would see in a magazine!!\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_612\"> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">Their prompt service is excellent and appreciated especially when we had to fly home on the Saturday after the wedding.\u00a0 Arnaud had all the pictures ready a couple of days later for us to select from and then the package was delivered the same evening at the front desk.\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">The whole process was stress free and worth every dollar!\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_575\"> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">If you choose HDC, you will definitely not be disappointed!!<\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_611\"> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_604\"> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">The Happy Couple,<\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_605\"> <span id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354284086146_573\" itemprop=\"reviewBody\">Lillian and Ravi<\/span><\/p> <p> <!-- google_ad_section_end --><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilliantjackson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1343269323,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258368.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LillianNov21","Id":258368,"Name":"LillianNov21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"752d225f6e44dab393ef7e62cc4e4c81","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am so excited! I have booked HDC for our wedding 8\/2013, I am so happy with all the great reviews!!!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1690908,"PostDate":1354286452,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am so excited! I have booked HDC for our wedding 8\/2013, I am so happy with all the great reviews!!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341022105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d241ede8bc9872ab0e2af10622097469","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; HDC was amazing!! They showed up right on time, Carlos did the video, Jorge did our wedding pictures, and Milan did our TTD session. &amp;nbsp;Arnaud is GREAT to work with, he responds right away!! They are so friendly and made our day so much fun. &amp;nbsp;Some of the pictures were amazing, you won&#039;t regret using them!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1691000,"PostDate":1354297295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> HDC was amazing!! They showed up right on time, Carlos did the video, Jorge did our wedding pictures, and Milan did our TTD session. \u00a0Arnaud is GREAT to work with, he responds right away!! They are so friendly and made our day so much fun. \u00a0Some of the pictures were amazing, you won't regret using them!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"edevine1031@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315235798,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244907.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"edevine","Id":244907,"Name":"edevine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6af842169ac8d70863d7d7e409c7faf","RawContent":"We absolutely loved these guys... Amazing experience all around. You will NOT be disappointed AT ALL!! The best pictures I&#039;ve ever seen. We look at our pics everyday.","Attachments":[],"Id":1691173,"PostDate":1354325283,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We absolutely loved these guys... Amazing experience all around. You will NOT be disappointed AT ALL!! The best pictures I've ever seen. We look at our pics everyday.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberlynae2@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1342289718,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257858.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Alynae2","Id":257858,"Name":"Alynae2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ae244faf6479e0d4ef4ba7926c651ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi everyone!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Anyone booked HDC for the Diamond package (6 hrs)?&amp;nbsp; Do you guys find that this package was too long?&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s long enough to cover everything, but is that really necessary?&amp;nbsp; Also we&#039;re considering getting the videography package as well but finding that combined (we&#039;re already booked to do a TTD session in the morning), I&#039;ll be paying a lot more than I wanted to.&amp;nbsp; What are your thoughts - do all 3, replace the TTD with the videography, or stick with what I have (photo and TTD)?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I \"want\" it all, but should I?!?!&amp;nbsp; HELP!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1691436,"PostDate":1354422301,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi everyone!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyone booked HDC for the Diamond package (6 hrs)?\u00a0 Do you guys find that this package was too long?\u00a0 It's long enough to cover everything, but is that really necessary?\u00a0 Also we're considering getting the videography package as well but finding that combined (we're already booked to do a TTD session in the morning), I'll be paying a lot more than I wanted to.\u00a0 What are your thoughts - do all 3, replace the TTD with the videography, or stick with what I have (photo and TTD)?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I \"want\" it all, but should I?!?!\u00a0 HELP!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pchowchinsung@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327116997,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250268.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tazziepoo","Id":250268,"Name":"tazziepoo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d685eeef0943858a12ceeda06cfc36d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I decided on the Diamond Package and the crazy trash the dress plus. I want as many pictures as I can of my wedding day. I was actually thinking of extending the ttd session! I want to have pictures through our reception so I feel as though the Diamond Package is perfect. If you want to keep costs down and want the videography just remember that there will be a separate person shooting and so you&#039;ll also have to add the vendor fees on top of that. Even so, its one day in your life you want to remember and be happy with, so I would say go for it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1692002,"PostDate":1354599281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I decided on the Diamond Package and the crazy trash the dress plus. I want as many pictures as I can of my wedding day. I was actually thinking of extending the ttd session! I want to have pictures through our reception so I feel as though the Diamond Package is perfect. If you want to keep costs down and want the videography just remember that there will be a separate person shooting and so you'll also have to add the vendor fees on top of that. Even so, its one day in your life you want to remember and be happy with, so I would say go for it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heidyeli725@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1291244134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234332.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tink","Id":234332,"Name":"Tink","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cfcc0966a9e46191841ffc1c518fed0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We just used HDC in Punta Cana at the Hard Rock.&amp;nbsp; They were wonderful from start to finish!! I highly recommend this company.&amp;nbsp; Arnaud and Federico were promt, fun and thorough!&amp;nbsp; We received our dvd and half our pics before we left and got a link to download the other half within a few days.&amp;nbsp; They did an amazing job!!&amp;nbsp;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1692563,"PostDate":1354729142,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We just used HDC in Punta Cana at the Hard Rock.\u00a0 They were wonderful from start to finish!! I highly recommend this company.\u00a0 Arnaud and Federico were promt, fun and thorough!\u00a0 We received our dvd and half our pics before we left and got a link to download the other half within a few days.\u00a0 They did an amazing job!!\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jmspecht@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1334945515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254298.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jj1010","Id":254298,"Name":"jj1010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"039e4087b76464074c3cf2ea356d3d58","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My husband and I got married spetember 2011 in peurto plata. We just cant say enough about the photos the quality was amazing the idea for pictures were un ending..I am so happy that we went with hdc and its too bad they are so far we live in canada and would love to have&amp;nbsp;them around for events. I know when i return to dominican i will contact them for future family portraits. TRULY AMAZING!!!!!\n \n COULDNT HAVE ASKED FOR BETTER MEMORIES DISPLAYED IN PHOTO.&lt;span alt=\":eclipsee_gold_cup:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354728023646_916\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/eclipsee_gold_cup.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"27\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354728023646_915\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/eclipsee_gold_cup.gif\" width=\"36\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n Deffinetly recommend them to anybody!!! you will deffinetly not be dissapointed.\n \n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1692564,"PostDate":1354729647,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My husband and I got married spetember 2011 in peurto plata. We just cant say enough about the photos the quality was amazing the idea for pictures were un ending..I am so happy that we went with hdc and its too bad they are so far we live in canada and would love to have\u00a0them around for events. I know when i return to dominican i will contact them for future family portraits. TRULY AMAZING!!!!!<br \/> <br \/> COULDNT HAVE ASKED FOR BETTER MEMORIES DISPLAYED IN PHOTO.<span alt=\":eclipsee_gold_cup:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354728023646_916\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/eclipsee_gold_cup.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"27\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1354728023646_915\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/eclipsee_gold_cup.gif\" width=\"36\" \/><\/span><\/span><br \/> Deffinetly recommend them to anybody!!! you will deffinetly not be dissapointed.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"azoriangangsta_cheekz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1354728017,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262966.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"staceyandpeter","Id":262966,"Name":"staceyandpeter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":112,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
