t;p&gt;Are there any brides out there planning a wedding in 2017 at the Barcel\u00f3 Maya Riviera?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Would love to hear from other brides planning a wedding around the same time frame :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stacy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913975,"PostDate":1464036873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are there any brides out there planning a wedding in 2017 at the Barcel\u00f3 Maya Riviera?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Would love to hear from other brides planning a wedding around the same time frame <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Stacy<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stasia2914@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.73.80.191","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442793909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"smfahey","Id":284874,"Name":"smfahey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"966aeb2d156bebc5f39cc9fd81e99e24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Stacy and Congrats on your Barcelo Maya dw next year!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ve chosen one of our favorite resorts and you can see why in these magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured at some of our weddings there....to show you what the backdrop of your photos will look like - enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq\/tag\/Barcelo-Wedding&#039;&gt;Barcelo Wedding Story Albums: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_ce39f76660c0435ca88d4eb0d2fc92d3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_ce39f76660c0435ca88d4eb0d2fc92d3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_ce39f76660c0435ca88d4eb0d2fc92d3.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913991,"PostDate":1464108101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Stacy and Congrats on your Barcelo Maya dw next year!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've chosen one of our favorite resorts and you can see why in these magical wedding moments that matter we've captured at some of our weddings there....to show you what the backdrop of your photos will look like - enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>....taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq\/tag\/Barcelo-Wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Wedding Story Albums: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_ce39f76660c0435ca88d4eb0d2fc92d3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_ce39f76660c0435ca88d4eb0d2fc92d3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_ce39f76660c0435ca88d4eb0d2fc92d3.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_0b5c161a0b99432f88eb9037622c2a40.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmot