;nbsp; Date?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you already reserved your package and been assigned to a WC?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914117,"PostDate":1464806574,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279411\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279411-mangosong\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mangosong<\/span><\/a> what resort are you getting married at?\u00a0 Date?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you already reserved your package and been assigned to a WC?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stasia2914@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.73.80.191","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442793909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"smfahey","Id":284874,"Name":"smfahey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.127.211.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c42245c00690ad1b6d91f01541d41c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"smfahey\"] We are getting married in Costa Rica.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our package has been reserved. For our resort, there is only one WC, so we just contacted her directly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914158,"PostDate":1464911347,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284874\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284874-smfahey\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smfahey<\/span><\/a> We are getting married in Costa Rica.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our package has been reserved. For our resort, there is only one WC, so we just contacted her directly.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407874186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.105.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"554be592028247376efaf803ae61e1f4","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hi Stacy,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just popping in to wish you a warm welcome to the BDW Forums. They are an invaluable resource for all your wedding needs, from hair\/makeup to lighting &amp;amp; decor, photography\/videography to meal plans &amp;amp; survival kits. Sometimes planning a wedding from a distance is difficult and know that there&#039;s plenty of us on here ready and willing to help.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nBarcelo is a beautiful resort, with plenty of various options for where to have your wedding ceremony, as well as your reception. We love working at that resort, as the grounds are well maintained, the staff is friendly and there&#039;s always new places to explore for photos.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nFeel free to follow this link to a wedding we photographed at the Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe gazebo space so you can get a feel for that space.\n\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/portfolio\/andrea-mich\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/portfolio\/andrea-mich\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nAnd I am attaching a few of our recent teasers from a May wedding we just finished photographing at Barcelo Maya Beach, but this ceremony location was utilizing the Playa Azul secluded beach space.\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;If you have any questions at all, about Barcelo or about wedding planning in general, please do not hesitate to ask us here, or in a private message or email.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nCheers!\n\nJasmin &amp;amp; Matt&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35893,"Name":"Heather_Josue_Teaser_01.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-84062300-1465324859.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-84062300-1465324859_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":666},{"Id":35894,"Name":"Heather_Josue_Teaser_02.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-65283400-1465324874.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-65283400-1465324874_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":35895,"Name":"Heather_Josue_Teaser_03.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-79330200-1465324896.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-79330200-1465324896_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":666},{"Id":35896,"Name":"Heather_Josue_Teaser_04.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-76763500-1465324912.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-76763500-1465324912_thumb.jpg","Width":801,"Height":1200},{"Id":35897,"Name":"Heather_Josue_Teaser_06.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-91860100-1465324935.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-91860100-1465324935_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668}],"Id":1914238,"PostDate":1465325086,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>\n<p>Hi Stacy,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just popping in to wish you a warm welcome to the BDW Forums. They are an invaluable resource for all your wedding needs, from hair\/makeup to lighting & decor, photography\/videography to meal plans & survival kits. Sometimes planning a wedding from a distance is difficult and know that there's plenty of us on here ready and willing to help.\u00a0<br><br>\nBarcelo is a beautiful resort, with plenty of various options for where to have your wedding ceremony, as well as your reception. We love working at that resort, as the grounds are well maintained, the staff is friendly and there's always new places to explore for photos.\u00a0<br><br>\nFeel free to follow this link to a wedding we photographed at the Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe gazebo space so you can get a feel for that space.<br><br>\n<a href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/portfolio\/andrea-mich\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jasminand...io\/andrea-mich\/<\/a><br><br>\nAnd I am attaching a few of our recent teasers from a May wedding we just finished photographing at Barcelo Maya Beach, but this ceremony location was utilizing the Playa Azul secluded beach space.<br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">If you have any questions at all, about Barcelo or about wedding planning in general, please do not hesitate to ask us here, or in a private message or email.\u00a0<br><br>\nCheers!<br>\nJasmin & Matt<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>Read our testimonials of appreciation from previous couples<\/a>\u00a0<3<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Rated 5 out of 5 stars on Facebook. <strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Check us out!<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464795939,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.202.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0325fa4847de55194139e0144cc17a89","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"smfahey\"] Congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are 5 hotels in Barcelo complex, we are sure it will be wonderful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Feel free to take a look&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18216]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914736,"PostDate":1467904900,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284874\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284874-smfahey\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">smfahey<\/span><\/a> Congrats!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There are 5 hotels in Barcelo complex, we are sure it will be wonderful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Feel free to take a look<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18216-grand-palladium-riviera-white-sands\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18216\/tn_gallery_287113_18216_2342325.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='WMP031816AM1 Photo 561'  width='75' height='75'  alt='WMP031816AM1 Photo 561' id='tn_image_view_83980_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18216-grand-palladium-riviera-white-sands\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Grand Palladium Riviera \/ White Sands<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>44 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span>Saludos<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><b>Virginia Hermosillo<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Dream Art \u00a0Wedding Photography<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span><span>contact<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:vhermosillo@dreamartphotography.com'>@dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Tel: +(52) 998 246-5657<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com'>http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src=\"http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com\/images\/wedding-logo-moto.png\" alt=\"wedding-logo-moto.png\"><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span>","Email":"contact@dreamartphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1465494801,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1468031793","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DreamArtPhotography","Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80105","Title":"Barcelo Maya Brides 2017!","LastPostDate":1467904900},"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
