                 img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                the link doesn't work either.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165985580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f652955a2ba89a3a5639e5688cd6f6a7","RawContent":"Tammy what is the average cost for a place like that? How much does it vary throughout the year?","Attachments":[],"Id":27244,"PostDate":1171704814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Tammy what is the average cost for a place like that? How much does it vary throughout the year?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janet.daly@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.33.145.106","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1138267740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206713.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":288,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Janet","Id":206713,"Name":"Janet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c93167895b10e6c22034c829250ebaa","RawContent":"Hello DR brides!\n \n I was considering Paradisus Palma Real for our wedding in February 2008. I exchanged e-mails with the wedding coordinator. She was great! However we decided to go with Cancun because we felt Cancun would have more experience with weddings and we are having our wedding at a non-all-inclusive (to avoid guest passes). I think Palma Real can still do a great wedding but it is an all-inclusive resort and I know our guests may not be able to afford it there so we will end up paying day passes for guests. \n \n If anyone wants information regarding the wedding packages at this resort please let me know.\n \n Jessica","Attachments":[],"Id":27350,"PostDate":1171760973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello DR brides!<br \/> <br \/> I was considering Paradisus Palma Real for our wedding in February 2008. I exchanged e-mails with the wedding coordinator. She was great! However we decided to go with Cancun because we felt Cancun would have more experience with weddings and we are having our wedding at a non-all-inclusive (to avoid guest passes). I think Palma Real can still do a great wedding but it is an all-inclusive resort and I know our guests may not be able to afford it there so we will end up paying day passes for guests. <br \/> <br \/> If anyone wants information regarding the wedding packages at this resort please let me know.<br \/> <br \/> Jessica\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jtds2713@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1168220212,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207033.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jtds2713","Id":207033,"Name":"Jtds2713","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa2b92096a1023245d3065fa8e7ffbc1","RawContent":"Here is a reply from Romance Specialist at Palma REal:\n \n Thank you for your interest in our resort and congratulations on your forthcoming wedding!\n \n \n \n (For room rates and reservations please contact &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:veneciat@solmelia-caribe.com\"&gt;veneciat@solmelia-caribe.com&lt;\/a&gt;)\n \n \n \n Here at Paradisus Palma Real we understand that your wedding day is one of the most important days of your life and we are here to assist you in creating your dream wedding in a Caribbean paradise.\n \n \n \n Please find attached our new and exclusive Paradisus Romance packages. You can, of course, add any extras or upgrade any part of your package.\n \n \n \n As well as choosing a package one of the most important options to consider is the type of ceremony you require. \n \n We offer 3 main types for you to choose from, however if you require any other type of ceremony do not hesitate to contact us for information.\n \n \n \n CEROMONIES: \n \n \n \n Symbolic ceremony \n \n This is included in all our packages. The service is taken by a non denominal minister and is almost identical to the civil ceremony except it is not legally binding,\n \n This is far less complicated than the other two options as you do not have to organize, translate and bring legal documents to Dominican Republic.\n \n If you want to be married legally this can be done in your home country before or after your stay with us.\n \n \n \n Civil ceremony\n \n A civil ceremony is performed by a Dominican Judge. This is legally binding and comes at an extra charge of $820 which, as well as covering the legal costs, includes the marriage certificate sent to your home address.\n \n PLEASE NOTE: This province of Dominican Republic has only ONE legal judge (for all hotels and locals!) which means securing a date and time is extremely difficult. If you require a civil ceremony please let us know as soon as possible as 2007 bookings are limited.\n \n *Note: The judge is not taking reservation for 2008 until April 2007\n \n \n \n Catholic Ceremony\n \n More formal than the other two options, the catholic ceremony is performed by the local Catholic Priest and is legally binding.\n \n Due to this being a religious ceremony, Catholic weddings cannot be held on the beach.\n \n *Extra charge applies\n \n \n \n \n \n LOCATIONS:\n \n This is dependant on the wishes of the bride and groom and number of guest attending. However here is a guide to our preferred ceremony locations:\n \n \n \n The Beach\n \n With the white sandy beaches, amazing turquoise waters and swaying palm trees \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Playa Bavaro\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n \n is an idyllic location for your wedding ceremony and caters to all group sizes.\n \n \n \n Pool Gazebo\n \n Beautifully designed, The Gazebo is located above the main pool and reached between 2 bridges. We recommend this for bridal parties of up to 15 people. \n \n The Gazebo should only be used in late afternoon \/ early evening due to location in the main pool.\n \n \n \n Garden Gazebo\n \n Petit, private and fabulous for ceremonies of 2 or 4 people, located in our hotel gardens.\n \n \n \n \n \n Our wish is to provide you with your dream wedding\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6\n \n \n \n I look forwards to hearing from you.\n \n \n \n Kindest regards\n \n \n \n Kelly Hunt\n \n Romance Manager\n \n \n \n Paradisus Palma Real\n \n Playa de Bavaro | Punta Cana | Higuey | Dominican Republic\n \n el. (809) 688-5000 ext.8080 | Fax&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;809) 552-0503\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:romance@paradisuspalmareal.com\"&gt;romance@paradisuspalmareal.com&lt;\/a&gt; | &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.paradisus.com\"&gt;Solmelia.com&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":27607,"PostDate":1171865856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is a reply from Romance Specialist at Palma REal:<br \/> <br \/> Thank you for your interest in our resort and congratulations on your forthcoming wedding!<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> (For room rates and reservations please contact <a href='mailto:veneciat@solmelia-caribe.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>veneciat@solmelia-caribe.com<\/a>)<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Here at Paradisus Palma Real we understand that your wedding day is one of the most important days of your life and we are here to assist you in creating your dream wedding in a Caribbean paradise.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Please find attached our new and exclusive Paradisus Romance packages. You can, of course, add any extras or upgrade any part of your package.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> As well as choosing a package one of the most important options to consider is the type of ceremony you require. <br \/> <br \/> We offer 3 main types for you to choose from, however if you require any other type of ceremony do not hesitate to contact us for information.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> CEROMONIES: <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Symbolic ceremony <br \/> <br \/> This is included in all our packages. The service is taken by a non denominal minister and is almost identical to the civil ceremony except it is not legally binding,<br \/> <br \/> This is far less complicated than the other two options as you do not have to organize, translate and bring legal documents to Dominican Republic.<br \/> <br \/> If you want to be married legally this can be done in your home country before or after your stay with us.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Civil ceremony<br \/> <br \/> A civil ceremony is performed by a Dominican Judge. This is legally binding and comes at an extra charge of $820 which, as well as covering the legal costs, includes the marriage certificate sent to your home address.<br \/> <br \/> PLEASE NOTE: This province of Dominican Republic has only ONE legal judge (for all hotels and locals!) which means securing a date and time is extremely difficult. If you require a civil ceremony please let us know as soon as possible as 2007 bookings are limited.<br \/> <br \/> *Note: The judge is not taking reservation for 2008 until April 2007<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Catholic Ceremony<br \/> <br \/> More formal than the other two options, the catholic ceremony is performed by the local Catholic Priest and is legally binding.<br \/> <br \/> Due to this being a religious ceremony, Catholic weddings cannot be held on the beach.<br \/> <br \/> *Extra charge applies<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> LOCATIONS:<br \/> <br \/> This is dependant on the wishes of the bride and groom and number of guest attending. However here is a guide to our preferred ceremony locations:<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> The Beach<br \/> <br \/> With the white sandy beaches, amazing turquoise waters and swaying palm trees \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Playa Bavaro\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> <br \/> is an idyllic location for your wedding ceremony and caters to all group sizes.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Pool Gazebo<br \/> <br \/> Beautifully designed, The Gazebo is located above the main pool and reached between 2 bridges. We recommend this for bridal parties of up to 15 people. <br \/> <br \/> The Gazebo should only be used in late afternoon \/ early evening due to location in the main pool.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Garden Gazebo<br \/> <br \/> Petit, private and fabulous for ceremonies of 2 or 4 people, located in our hotel gardens.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Our wish is to provide you with your dream wedding\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I look forwards to hearing from you.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Kindest regards<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Kelly Hunt<br \/> <br \/> Romance Manager<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Paradisus Palma Real<br \/> <br \/> Playa de Bavaro | Punta Cana | Higuey | Dominican Republic<br \/> <br \/> el. (809) 688-5000 ext.8080 | Fax<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>809) 552-0503<br \/> <br \/> <a href='mailto:romance@paradisuspalmareal.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>romance@paradisuspalmareal.com<\/a> | <a href='http:\/\/www.paradisus.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Solmelia.com<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jtds2713@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1168220212,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207033.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jtds2713","Id":207033,"Name":"Jtds2713","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"63","Title":"**Paradisus Palma Real Details & Discussion Thread**","LastPostDate":1467828205},"Pages":{"TotalItems":227,"TotalPages":23,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":220},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
