{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bb87c98f08e4389933c49afb1eef990","RawContent":"Here are the packages at Palma Real:\n \n Paradisus Resorts Romance Packages \n Official Rates 2007\n \n Honeymoons &amp;amp; Anniversaries\n \n \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE GLOW\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n Honeymoon &amp;amp; Anniversary Complimentary* Package\n \n In-Room Bottle of Chilled Domestic Champagne\n Luscious Tropical Fruit Display \n In-Bed Romantic Breakfast with Mimosas (one morning during stay) \n Surprise Gift for the Couple\n Romantic turn down-service \n 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple\n \n TERMS AND CONDITIONS \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE GLOW\u00e2\u20ac\u009d:\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Complimentary when booking minimum 7 night stay in a Royal Service or Romance Suite, double adult occupancy\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Accommodations are not included \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Copy of Marriage certificate is needed upon arrival\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Minimum 30 day advance notice for package to be valid\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Reservation must include note of GLOW package requirement\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Couples whom are not eligible for THE GLOW can purchase it for $ 200 USD \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Validity: 20 December, 2006-19 December, 2007\n \n \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE PASSION\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n Honeymoon &amp;amp; Anniversary Package\n In-Room Bottle of Chilled Sparkling Wine\n Luscious Tropical Fruit Display upon arrival\n In-Bed Romantic Breakfast with Mimosas (one morning during your stay)\n Surprise Gift for the Couple \n 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple\n 1 Couples Massage\n Romantic Jacuzzi d\u00a9cor with Flower Petals &amp;amp; Candles for the Couple \n Special Turn-Down amenities During your Stay\n Private Couples Romantic Dinner*\n Late Check-out for the Couple until 4pm (subject to availability)\n *Dinner location will be determined upon arrival to Resort\n \n RESORT &amp;amp; DESTINATIONRATES PER COUPLE \n \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE PASSION\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\n COSTA RICA Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 600\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 550\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 450\n MEXICO Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortUS$ 550\n PUERTO RICO Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortUS$ 750\n TERMS AND CONDITIONS - \u00e2\u20ac\u0153 THE PASSION\u00e2\u20ac\u009d - :\n &#61656;Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions\n &#61656;Accommodations are not included \n &#61656;Validity: 14th February, 2007 \u00e2\u20ac\u201c 13 February 2008\n \n \n \n \n Weddings &amp;amp; Renewals of Vows\n \n \n \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE WISH\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\n Wedding &amp;amp; Renewal of Vows Complimentary* Package\n Up to 6 guests\n \n Symbolic Ceremony with our Minister\n The expertise of our Romance Specialist, to help in planning all details to perfection\n Welcome Letter\n Romantic Turn-down Service during your stay\n Alternative locations for Ceremony\n Bouquet for the Bride \n Matching Boutonni\u00a8re for the Groom \n Recorded Background Music during the Ceremony\n 1 Bottle of Domestic Champagne for the Wedding Toast\n Paradisus Wedding Cake (your choice of Vanilla or Chocolate)\n Basic Ceremony Set-up\n Guaranteed Reservation for maximum 6 guests in your choice of Resort Restaurant in the evening\n Personalized Menu Cards for maximum 6 guests\n In-room Bottle of Domestic Red, or White Wine or Champagne on the night of the Ceremony for the Couple\n 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple (not including products)\n Late Check-out for the Couple until 4pm (subject to availability)\n \n RESORT &amp;amp; DESTINATIONRATES \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE WISH\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\n COSTA RICA\n Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 850\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC\n Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 800\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC \n Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 700\n MEXICO\n Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortUS$ 800\n PUERTO RICO\n Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortUS$ 1,200\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n TERMS AND CONDITIONS \u00e2\u20ac\u0153 THE WISH\u00e2\u20ac\u009d:\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Complimentary with a Minimum 7 night stay in a Royal Service Ocean View or Romance Suite\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Accommodations are not included\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Maximum for 6 In-House Guests\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Couples whom are not eligible for THE WISH may purchase this package, priced per resort\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE FANTASY\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n Wedding &amp;amp; Renewal of Vows Package\n Up to 20 guests\n \n Symbolic Ceremony with our Minister\n The expertise of our Romance Specialist, to help in planning all details to perfection\n Welcome Letter\n Alternative locations for Ceremony\n Bouquet for the Bride\n Boutonni\u00a8re for the Groom \n CD Recorded Music during the Ceremony\n Sparkling Wine for the Wedding Toast (up to 8 Bottles)\n Wedding Cake (your choice of Vanilla or Chocolate)\n Basic Ceremony &amp;amp; Cocktail Party Set-up\n 1 Hour Post-Ceremony Cocktail Party to include 5 cold Hors D&#039;oeuvres per person with Sparkling &amp;amp; Still Waters \n In-room Bottle of Red, White or Sparkling Wine on the night of the ceremony for the Couple\n 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple (not including products)\n Late Check-out for the Couple until 4pm (subject to availability)\n Romantic Turn-down during Couples Stay\n \n \n \n RESORT &amp;amp; DESTINATIONRATES \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE FANTASY\u00e2\u20ac\u009dADDITIONAL IN-HOUSE GUEST\n COSTA RICA\n Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 1,450US$ 35\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC\n Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 1,400US$ 35\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC \n Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 1,250US$ 30\n MEXICO\n Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortUS$ 1,300US$ 30\n PUERTO RICO\n Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortUS$ 2,000US$ 50\n \n \n TERMS AND CONDITIONS \u00e2\u20ac\u201c \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE FANTASY\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \u00e2\u20ac\u201c \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Up to 20 In-House Guests-1 Hour Cocktail Party, additional service time will be charged per hour \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Accommodations are not included \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a21 Hour Soft Bar available\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Full open bar will have an additional fee per person per hour\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Surcharge per additional In-House Guest\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Guests not staying at the resort will pay other fee\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 12 pay \u00bd\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 3 are free\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE AQUA\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n Designer Wedding and Reception Package\n Up to 20 guests\n \n The Ceremony\n Symbolic Ceremony with Non-Denominational Minister\n Romance Specialist, to help you in planning your every event\n Welcome Letter\n Alternative locations for Ceremony\n Bouquet for the Bride\n Boutonni\u00a8re for the Groom\n CD Recorded Music during the Ceremony\n Up to 8 Bottles of Sparkling Wine for the Ceremony Toast \n Basic Ceremony Set-up\n In-room Bottle of Red, White or Sparkling Wine on the night of the ceremony for the Couple\n 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple (not including products)\n Late Check-out for the Couple until 4pm (subject to availability)\n Romantic Turn-down during Couples Stay\n \n \n The Reception\n 1\/2 Hour Post-Ceremony Cocktail Party to include 3 Passed Hors D&#039;oeuvres per person with Sparkling &amp;amp; Still Waters \n Hints of Vibrant Aqua Organza Linen\n Imperial Style Seating for the Reception\n 3 Course Dinner Menu\n Bright Tropical Libations, 3 drinks per person\n Wedding Cake: White Meringue with Aqua Pearls\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6 Seashells to Adorn\n Tea Lights throughout\n \n RESORT &amp;amp; DESTINATIONRATES \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE AQUA\u00e2\u20ac\u009dADDITIONAL IN-HOUSE GUEST\n COSTA RICA\n Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 3,200US$ 80\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC\n Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 3,100US$ 75\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC \n Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 3,000US$ 75\n MEXICO\n Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortUS$ 3,100US$ 85\n PUERTO RICO\n Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortUS$ 3,800US$ 85\n \n TERMS AND CONDITIONS \u00e2\u20ac\u201c \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE AQUA\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 - \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Plated Dinner is for up to 20 In-House Guests\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Accommodations are not included \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Service for up to 3 hours, additional service time will be charged per hour \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Includes soft bar plus 3 specialty cocktails per guest\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Full open bar will have an additional fee per person (tbd)\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Surcharge per additional In-House Guest is available for the Plated Dinner\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Guests not staying at the resort will pay other fee\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 12 pay \u00bd\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 3 are Free\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions\n \n \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE CHILL-OUT CHIC\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n Designer Wedding and Reception Package\n Up to 20 guests\n \n The Ceremony\n Symbolic Ceremony with Non-Denominational Minister\n Romance Specialist, to help you in planning your every event\n Welcome Letter\n Alternative locations for Ceremony\n Bouquet for the Bride\n Boutonni\u00a8re for the Groom\n CD Recorded Music during the Ceremony\n Up to 8 Bottles of Sparkling Wine for the Ceremony Toast \n Basic Ceremony Set-up\n In-room Bottle of Red, White or Sparkling Wine on the night of the ceremony for the Couple\n 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple (not including products)\n Late Check-out for the Couple until 4pm (subject to availability)\n Romantic Turn-down during Couples Stay\n \n The Reception\n 1\/2 Hour Post-Ceremony Cocktail Party to include 3 Passed Hors D&#039;oeuvres per person with Sparkling &amp;amp; Still Waters \n Chill-out Lay out, bali beds, lounge couches, square or round white ottomans\n Low laying coffee tables &amp;amp; side tables\n Chocolate brown organza &amp;amp; sandy taupe canvas, tiki torches\n Imperial Style Seating for the Reception\n Minimalist Buffet Table featuring 2 protein, 3 salads &amp;amp; 2 starch items- option of sharing menus, easy to eat on a couch, without table to lean on \n Fruit Juices spiked with Vodka, Coco Rum or Rum, 3 drinks per person\n Wedding Cake: Square &amp;amp; white\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6 with chocolate pearls to adorn\n Tea Lights throughout\n \n RESORT &amp;amp; DESTINATIONRATES \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE CHILL OUT CHIC\u00e2\u20ac\u009dADDITIONAL IN-HOUSE GUEST\n COSTA RICA\n Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 2,700US$ 65\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC\n Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 2,750US$ 65\n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC \n Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 2,550US$ 60\n MEXICO\n Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortUS$ 6,100US$ 150\n PUERTO RICO\n Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortUS$ 3,400US$ 95\n TERMS AND CONDITIONS \u00e2\u20ac\u201c \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE CHILL-OUT CHIC\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Buffet Dinner for up to 20 In-House Guests, surcharge also available if Plated Dinner is required\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Accommodations are not included \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Service for up to 3 hours, additional service time will be charged per hour \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Includes soft bar plus 3 specialty cocktails per guest\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Full open bar will have an additional fee per person \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Surcharge per additional In-House Guest\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Guests not staying at the resort will pay other fee \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 12 pay \u00bd\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 3 are Free\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Add $10 USD to the Surcharge per In-House Guest to make it a Plated Sit-down dinner\n \n \n IMPORTANT CONDITIONS TO REMEMBER\n \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Packages are effective for Romance Events occurring on and after February 14, 2007, with exception to THE GLOW which is applicable as of the 20th of December 2006\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2The Glow, The Passion, The Wish, The Fantasy, The Aqua, The Chill Out Chic have to be booked directly with the Resort\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Romance Specialists.\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Legal and\/ or Religious Ceremony have a surcharge, priced per Resort\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2The Glow, The Passion, The Wish, The Fantasy, The Aqua, The Chill Out Chic are all commissionable 20% to Tour Operators and Wholesalers and 10% to Travel Agents and\/or Wedding planners\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2All other Romance customized events (Romantic dinners, Bachelor\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s and Bachelorette\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s parties, etc) are non-commissionable \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Deposits &amp;amp; contracts are to be signed by all parties involved in order to confirm any Romance Package \n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Day &amp;amp; Night Passes are required for ALL Guests not staying at the Ceremony or Event Resort, priced per resort\n \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2All Package Pricing &amp;amp; Inclusions are subject to change without prior notification\n \n \n HOW TO BOOK \u00e2\u20ac\u0153ROMANCE BY PARADISUS\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\n \n RESORT &amp;amp; DESTINATIONROMANCE SPECIALISTPHONE &amp;amp; FAXEMAIL\n COSTA RICA\n Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortDenisse Skov\n Romance SpecialistTel: 011. 506. 654. 4123\n Fax: 011. 506. 654. 4181\n E-mail: \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:weddings@paradisusplayaconchal.com\"&gt;weddings@paradisusplayaconchal.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC\n Paradisus Palma Real ResortKelly Hunt\n Romance ManagerTel. 1. 809. 688. 5000 Ext: 8080\n Fax: 1. 809. 688. 5800E-mail:\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:romance@paradisuspalmareal.com\"&gt;romance@paradisuspalmareal.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n DOMINICAN REPUBLIC \n Paradisus Punta Cana ResortYadilis Santana\n Romance Specialist\n Tel: 1. 809. 285. 8044 \n Fax: 1. 809. 221. 7383\n E-mail: \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:grupos2.paradisus.punta.cana@solmelia.com\"&gt;grupos2.paradisus.punta.cana@solmelia.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n MEXICO\n Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortElisa Amora Hern\u00a1ndez\n Romance SpecialistTel: 011. 52. 998. 872. 8383\n Fax: 011. 52. 998 872. 8390\n E-mail: \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:guest.paradisus.riviera.cancun@solmelia.com\"&gt;guest.paradisus.riviera.cancun@solmelia.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n \n PUERTO RICO\n Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortYolanda Rosa\n Romance SpecialistTel: 1. 787. 657. 1026\n Fax: 1. 787. 657. 1060\n Email: \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:yolandar@paradisuspr.com\"&gt;yolandar@paradisuspr.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n \n Jessica","Attachments":[],"Id":27609,"PostDate":1171866072,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here are the packages at Palma Real:<br \/> <br \/> Paradisus Resorts Romance Packages <br \/> Official Rates 2007<br \/> <br \/> Honeymoons & Anniversaries<br \/> <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE GLOW\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> Honeymoon & Anniversary Complimentary* Package<br \/> <br \/> In-Room Bottle of Chilled Domestic Champagne<br \/> Luscious Tropical Fruit Display <br \/> In-Bed Romantic Breakfast with Mimosas (one morning during stay) <br \/> Surprise Gift for the Couple<br \/> Romantic turn down-service <br \/> 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple<br \/> <br \/> TERMS AND CONDITIONS \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE GLOW\u00e2\u20ac\u009d:<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Complimentary when booking minimum 7 night stay in a Royal Service or Romance Suite, double adult occupancy<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Accommodations are not included <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Copy of Marriage certificate is needed upon arrival<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Minimum 30 day advance notice for package to be valid<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Reservation must include note of GLOW package requirement<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Couples whom are not eligible for THE GLOW can purchase it for $ 200 USD <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Validity: 20 December, 2006-19 December, 2007<br \/> <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE PASSION\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> Honeymoon & Anniversary Package<br \/> In-Room Bottle of Chilled Sparkling Wine<br \/> Luscious Tropical Fruit Display upon arrival<br \/> In-Bed Romantic Breakfast with Mimosas (one morning during your stay)<br \/> Surprise Gift for the Couple <br \/> 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple<br \/> 1 Couples Massage<br \/> Romantic Jacuzzi d\u00c3\u00a9cor with Flower Petals & Candles for the Couple <br \/> Special Turn-Down amenities During your Stay<br \/> Private Couples Romantic Dinner*<br \/> Late Check-out for the Couple until 4pm (subject to availability)<br \/> *Dinner location will be determined upon arrival to Resort<br \/> <br \/> RESORT & DESTINATIONRATES PER COUPLE <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE PASSION\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<br \/> COSTA RICA Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 600<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 550<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 450<br \/> MEXICO Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortUS$ 550<br \/> PUERTO RICO Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortUS$ 750<br \/> TERMS AND CONDITIONS - \u00e2\u20ac\u0153 THE PASSION\u00e2\u20ac\u009d - :<br \/> &#61656;Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions<br \/> &#61656;Accommodations are not included <br \/> &#61656;Validity: 14th February, 2007 \u00e2\u20ac\u201c 13 February 2008<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Weddings & Renewals of Vows<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE WISH\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<br \/> Wedding & Renewal of Vows Complimentary* Package<br \/> Up to 6 guests<br \/> <br \/> Symbolic Ceremony with our Minister<br \/> The expertise of our Romance Specialist, to help in planning all details to perfection<br \/> Welcome Letter<br \/> Romantic Turn-down Service during your stay<br \/> Alternative locations for Ceremony<br \/> Bouquet for the Bride <br \/> Matching Boutonni\u00c3\u00a8re for the Groom <br \/> Recorded Background Music during the Ceremony<br \/> 1 Bottle of Domestic Champagne for the Wedding Toast<br \/> Paradisus Wedding Cake (your choice of Vanilla or Chocolate)<br \/> Basic Ceremony Set-up<br \/> Guaranteed Reservation for maximum 6 guests in your choice of Resort Restaurant in the evening<br \/> Personalized Menu Cards for maximum 6 guests<br \/> In-room Bottle of Domestic Red, or White Wine or Champagne on the night of the Ceremony for the Couple<br \/> 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple (not including products)<br \/> Late Check-out for the Couple until 4pm (subject to availability)<br \/> <br \/> RESORT & DESTINATIONRATES \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE WISH\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<br \/> COSTA RICA<br \/> Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 850<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC<br \/> Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 800<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC <br \/> Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 700<br \/> MEXICO<br \/> Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortUS$ 800<br \/> PUERTO RICO<br \/> Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortUS$ 1,200<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> TERMS AND CONDITIONS \u00e2\u20ac\u0153 THE WISH\u00e2\u20ac\u009d:<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Complimentary with a Minimum 7 night stay in a Royal Service Ocean View or Romance Suite<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Accommodations are not included<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Maximum for 6 In-House Guests<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Couples whom are not eligible for THE WISH may purchase this package, priced per resort<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE FANTASY\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> Wedding & Renewal of Vows Package<br \/> Up to 20 guests<br \/> <br \/> Symbolic Ceremony with our Minister<br \/> The expertise of our Romance Specialist, to help in planning all details to perfection<br \/> Welcome Letter<br \/> Alternative locations for Ceremony<br \/> Bouquet for the Bride<br \/> Boutonni\u00c3\u00a8re for the Groom <br \/> CD Recorded Music during the Ceremony<br \/> Sparkling Wine for the Wedding Toast (up to 8 Bottles)<br \/> Wedding Cake (your choice of Vanilla or Chocolate)<br \/> Basic Ceremony & Cocktail Party Set-up<br \/> 1 Hour Post-Ceremony Cocktail Party to include 5 cold Hors D'oeuvres per person with Sparkling & Still Waters <br \/> In-room Bottle of Red, White or Sparkling Wine on the night of the ceremony for the Couple<br \/> 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple (not including products)<br \/> Late Check-out for the Couple until 4pm (subject to availability)<br \/> Romantic Turn-down during Couples Stay<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> RESORT & DESTINATIONRATES \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE FANTASY\u00e2\u20ac\u009dADDITIONAL IN-HOUSE GUEST<br \/> COSTA RICA<br \/> Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 1,450US$ 35<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC<br \/> Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 1,400US$ 35<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC <br \/> Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 1,250US$ 30<br \/> MEXICO<br \/> Paradisus Riviera Cancun Res