l Style Seating for the Reception<br \/> 3 Course Dinner Menu<br \/> Bright Tropical Libations, 3 drinks per person<br \/> Wedding Cake: White Meringue with Aqua Pearls\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6 Seashells to Adorn<br \/> Tea Lights throughout<br \/> <br \/> RESORT & DESTINATIONRATES \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE AQUA\u00e2\u20ac\u009dADDITIONAL IN-HOUSE GUEST<br \/> COSTA RICA<br \/> Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 3,200US$ 80<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC<br \/> Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 3,100US$ 75<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC <br \/> Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 3,000US$ 75<br \/> MEXICO<br \/> Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortUS$ 3,100US$ 85<br \/> PUERTO RICO<br \/> Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortUS$ 3,800US$ 85<br \/> <br \/> TERMS AND CONDITIONS \u00e2\u20ac\u201c \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE AQUA\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 - <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Plated Dinner is for up to 20 In-House Guests<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Accommodations are not included <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Service for up to 3 hours, additional service time will be charged per hour <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Includes soft bar plus 3 specialty cocktails per guest<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Full open bar will have an additional fee per person (tbd)<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Surcharge per additional In-House Guest is available for the Plated Dinner<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Guests not staying at the resort will pay other fee<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 12 pay \u00c2\u00bd<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 3 are Free<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions<br \/> <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE CHILL-OUT CHIC\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> Designer Wedding and Reception Package<br \/> Up to 20 guests<br \/> <br \/> The Ceremony<br \/> Symbolic Ceremony with Non-Denominational Minister<br \/> Romance Specialist, to help you in planning your every event<br \/> Welcome Letter<br \/> Alternative locations for Ceremony<br \/> Bouquet for the Bride<br \/> Boutonni\u00c3\u00a8re for the Groom<br \/> CD Recorded Music during the Ceremony<br \/> Up to 8 Bottles of Sparkling Wine for the Ceremony Toast <br \/> Basic Ceremony Set-up<br \/> In-room Bottle of Red, White or Sparkling Wine on the night of the ceremony for the Couple<br \/> 10% Discount on Spa Services for the Couple (not including products)<br \/> Late Check-out for the Couple until 4pm (subject to availability)<br \/> Romantic Turn-down during Couples Stay<br \/> <br \/> The Reception<br \/> 1\/2 Hour Post-Ceremony Cocktail Party to include 3 Passed Hors D'oeuvres per person with Sparkling & Still Waters <br \/> Chill-out Lay out, bali beds, lounge couches, square or round white ottomans<br \/> Low laying coffee tables & side tables<br \/> Chocolate brown organza & sandy taupe canvas, tiki torches<br \/> Imperial Style Seating for the Reception<br \/> Minimalist Buffet Table featuring 2 protein, 3 salads & 2 starch items- option of sharing menus, easy to eat on a couch, without table to lean on <br \/> Fruit Juices spiked with Vodka, Coco Rum or Rum, 3 drinks per person<br \/> Wedding Cake: Square & white\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6 with chocolate pearls to adorn<br \/> Tea Lights throughout<br \/> <br \/> RESORT & DESTINATIONRATES \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE CHILL OUT CHIC\u00e2\u20ac\u009dADDITIONAL IN-HOUSE GUEST<br \/> COSTA RICA<br \/> Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortUS$ 2,700US$ 65<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC<br \/> Paradisus Palma Real ResortUS$ 2,750US$ 65<br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC <br \/> Paradisus Punta Cana ResortUS$ 2,550US$ 60<br \/> MEXICO<br \/> Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortUS$ 6,100US$ 150<br \/> PUERTO RICO<br \/> Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortUS$ 3,400US$ 95<br \/> TERMS AND CONDITIONS \u00e2\u20ac\u201c \u00e2\u20ac\u0153THE CHILL-OUT CHIC\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Buffet Dinner for up to 20 In-House Guests, surcharge also available if Plated Dinner is required<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Accommodations are not included <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Service for up to 3 hours, additional service time will be charged per hour <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Includes soft bar plus 3 specialty cocktails per guest<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Full open bar will have an additional fee per person <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Surcharge per additional In-House Guest<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Guests not staying at the resort will pay other fee <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 12 pay \u00c2\u00bd<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Additional kids under 3 are Free<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Items are not interchangeable for other inclusions<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Add $10 USD to the Surcharge per In-House Guest to make it a Plated Sit-down dinner<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> IMPORTANT CONDITIONS TO REMEMBER<br \/> <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Packages are effective for Romance Events occurring on and after February 14, 2007, with exception to THE GLOW which is applicable as of the 20th of December 2006<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2The Glow, The Passion, The Wish, The Fantasy, The Aqua, The Chill Out Chic have to be booked directly with the Resort\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Romance Specialists.<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Legal and\/ or Religious Ceremony have a surcharge, priced per Resort<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2The Glow, The Passion, The Wish, The Fantasy, The Aqua, The Chill Out Chic are all commissionable 20% to Tour Operators and Wholesalers and 10% to Travel Agents and\/or Wedding planners<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2All other Romance customized events (Romantic dinners, Bachelor\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s and Bachelorette\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s parties, etc) are non-commissionable <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Deposits & contracts are to be signed by all parties involved in order to confirm any Romance Package <br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2Day & Night Passes are required for ALL Guests not staying at the Ceremony or Event Resort, priced per resort<br \/> \u00e2\u20ac\u00a2All Package Pricing & Inclusions are subject to change without prior notification<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> HOW TO BOOK \u00e2\u20ac\u0153ROMANCE BY PARADISUS\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<br \/> <br \/> RESORT & DESTINATIONROMANCE SPECIALISTPHONE & FAXEMAIL<br \/> COSTA RICA<br \/> Paradisus Playa Conchal ResortDenisse Skov<br \/> Romance SpecialistTel: 011. 506. 654. 4123<br \/> Fax: 011. 506. 654. 4181<br \/> E-mail: <br \/> <br \/> <a href='mailto:weddings@paradisusplayaconchal.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings@paradisusplayaconchal.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC<br \/> Paradisus Palma Real ResortKelly Hunt<br \/> Romance ManagerTel. 1. 809. 688. 5000 Ext: 8080<br \/> Fax: 1. 809. 688. 5800E-mail:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='mailto:romance@paradisuspalmareal.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>romance@paradisuspalmareal.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> DOMINICAN REPUBLIC <br \/> Paradisus Punta Cana ResortYadilis Santana<br \/> Romance Specialist<br \/> Tel: 1. 809. 285. 8044 <br \/> Fax: 1. 809. 221. 7383<br \/> E-mail: <br \/> <br \/> <a href='mailto:grupos2.paradisus.punta.cana@solmelia.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>grupos2.paradisus.punta.cana@solmelia.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> MEXICO<br \/> Paradisus Riviera Cancun ResortElisa Amora Hern\u00c3\u00a1ndez<br \/> Romance SpecialistTel: 011. 52. 998. 872. 8383<br \/> Fax: 011. 52. 998 872. 8390<br \/> E-mail: <br \/> <br \/> <a href='mailto:guest.paradisus.riviera.cancun@solmelia.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>guest.paradisus.riviera.cancun@solmelia.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> PUERTO RICO<br \/> Paradisus Puerto Rico ResortYolanda Rosa<br \/> Romance SpecialistTel: 1. 787. 657. 1026<br \/> Fax: 1. 787. 657. 1060<br \/> Email: <br \/> <br \/> <a href='mailto:yolandar@paradisuspr.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>yolandar@paradisuspr.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Jessica\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jtds2713@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1168220212,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207033.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jtds2713","Id":207033,"Name":"Jtds2713","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbd2f665b4f62994218b8554f6c74f6a","RawContent":"Here is the Wedding Planning Price List at Palma Real:","Attachments":[],"Id":27610,"PostDate":1171866241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is the Wedding Planning Price List at Palma Real:\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jtds2713@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1168220212,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207033.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jtds2713","Id":207033,"Name":"Jtds2713","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ba728856b247b9d65da9f49bbd54fb7","RawContent":"Here is the WEdding Planning Price List at Palma Real:","Attachments":[],"Id":27612,"PostDate":1171866426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is the WEdding Planning Price List at Palma Real:\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jtds2713@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1168220212,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207033.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jtds2713","Id":207033,"Name":"Jtds2713","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eab486711e53bcf9f41e597e725ac1f4","RawContent":"We were looking at the Palma Real but for my sister with two kids, the cost for their holiday package was too much.\n \n The resort looks wonderful and my travel agent who went down there to check it out for us said that it was one of the most beautiful wedding set-ups. She showed us pictures and it looks amazing.","Attachments":[],"Id":27686,"PostDate":1171907474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We were looking at the Palma Real but for my sister with two kids, the cost for their holiday package was too much.<br \/> <br \/> The resort looks wonderful and my travel agent who went down there to check it out for us said that it was one of the most beautiful wedding set-ups. She showed us pictures and it looks amazing.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"paddlegurl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1171616211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207171.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"paddlegurl","Id":207171,"Name":"paddlegurl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31b531acfbc5eed0be559e3335c2fab6","RawContent":"I am getting married in a private villa in Cabrera which is much further north than Punta Cana, but I am going on the first leg of my honeymoon to the Paradisus and let me just say, everything I have seen and heard has been great. \n You can not beat the price, which allowed us to upgrade to a better room and the reviews are above average. \n I would love to hear from anyone who has been and I bet a wedding here would be beautiful!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":37099,"PostDate":1174765843,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting married in a private villa in Cabrera which is much further north than Punta Cana, but I am going on the first leg of my honeymoon to the Paradisus and let me just say, everything I have seen and heard has been great. <br \/> You can not beat the price, which allowed us to upgrade to a better room and the reviews are above average. <br \/> I would love to hear from anyone who has been and I bet a wedding here would be beautiful!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishialoha@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.234.1.193","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1174628040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207282.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":216,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mishi","Id":207282,"Name":"Mishi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4095fbde0eb8b178b0ec91c49d9ea0f","RawContent":"Hi everyone! I&#039;m from NYC and will get married may 31 2008 At Paradisus Palma Real in Punta Cana Dom. Rep.\n I&#039;m not able to see the pictures either!","Attachments":[],"Id":43281,"PostDate":1176686689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! I'm from NYC and will get married may 31 2008 At Paradisus Palma Real in Punta Cana Dom. Rep.<br \/> I'm not able to see the pictures either!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Salome U.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"salomeuh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1176610035,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207346.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"salomeuh","Id":207346,"Name":"salomeuh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7e3368fef8605e2e5fcfaa804ae6f8b","RawContent":"Good Morning Ladies! \n \n \n I wanted to introduce myself - my name is Kelly and I am the Romance Manager at Palma Real, myself and my assistant Emy are avaialable to answer any questions you may have about your wedding and honeymoon with us. I only ask that you email us directly as we cannot check the forums very often (we are busy making sure your weddings are fabulous!&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"mswink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; )\n \n Kelly: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:Romance@paradisuspalmareal.com\"&gt;Romance@paradisuspalmareal.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n Emy: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:Romancepprl@paradisuspalmareal.com\"&gt;Romancepprl@paradisuspalmareal.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Some of the information I have seen on the forum is out of date, I have attached the updated information, but please feel free to send us you email address and we will send you the information, photos, packages and prices!\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/attachment.php?s=dfbfb5df2e227e10a1ec66dacd051e68&amp;amp;attachmentid=633\"&gt;Attachment 633&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/attachment.php?s=dfbfb5df2e227e10a1ec66dacd051e68&amp;amp;attachmentid=634\"&gt;Attachment 634&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n \n We are waiting for you in paradise...&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;3980&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Romance wedding calculator.xls&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:42,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;xls&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":53613,"PostDate":1179510116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good Morning Ladies! <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I wanted to introduce myself - my name is Kelly and I am the Romance Manager at Palma Real, myself and my assistant Emy are avaialable to answer any questions you may have about your wedding and honeymoon with us. I only ask that you email us directly as we cannot check the forums very often (we are busy making sure your weddings are fabulous!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"mswink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> )<br \/> <br \/> Kelly: <a href='mailto:Romance@paradisuspalmareal.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Romance@paradisuspalmareal.com<\/a><br \/> Emy: <a href='mailto:Romancepprl@paradisuspalmareal.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Romancepprl@paradisuspalmareal.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Some of the information I have seen on the forum is out of date, I have attached the updated information, but please feel free to send us you email address and we will send you the information, photos, packages and prices!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/attachment.php?s=dfbfb5df2e227e10a1ec66dacd051e68&attachmentid=633' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Attachment 633<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/attachment.php?s=dfbfb5df2e227e10a1ec66dacd051e68&attachmentid=634' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Attachment 634<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> We are waiting for you in paradise...<p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"3980\",\"name\":\"Romance wedding calculator.xls\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":42,\"type\":\"xls\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kelly Hunt<\/span><br><span>Romance Manager<\/span><br><br><span>Paradisus Palma Real<\/span><br><span>Playa de Bavaro | Punta Cana | Higuey | Dominican RepublicTel. (809) 688-5000 ext.8080 <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"mailto:romance@paradisuspalmareal.com\">romance@paradisuspalmareal.com<\/a><span> | <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.paradisus.com\">www.paradisus.com<\/a><span> \"We love a love story...\" <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.romancebyparadisus.com\">www.romancebyparadisus.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"romance@paradisuspalmareal.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1178732178,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207393.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Romance Manager\/WP","Id":207393,"Name":"Romance Manager\/WP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9eddfb5eb8628c73fc788a6f044115b8","RawContent":"Thank you very much Kelly!","Attachments":[],"Id":53711,"PostDate":1179541955,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you very much Kelly!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Salome U.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"salomeuh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1176610035,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207346.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"salomeuh","Id":207346,"Name":"salomeuh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a17c1b60b8e3d629841ab6367243301e","RawContent":"Any feedback on the Palma Real regarding these topics would be great. We are very close to booking our wedding there for early next summer:\n Beach ceremony and reception (including menu choices)\n Activities for kids\n Group room reservations\n Photographer and video feedback\n \n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":315402,"PostDate":1211671023,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Any feedback on the Palma Real regarding these topics would be great. We are very close to booking our wedding there for early next summer:<br \/> Beach ceremony and reception (including menu choices)<br \/> Activities for kids<br \/> Group room reservations<br \/> Photographer and video feedback<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jensatt18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1211426503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209527.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jensatt18","Id":209527,"Name":"jensatt18","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2df0f6694f3cb97ecfc11790b343c57e","RawContent":"Hi Jen\n \n You might want to check this website ...there are a lot of info and reviews about Palma Real weddings.\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/debsdrtravels.proboards47.com\/index.cgi?board=wedding&amp;amp;action=display&amp;amp;thread=6196&amp;amp;page=1\"&gt;Debbie&#039;s Dominican Travel Forums - Paradisus Palma Real Weddings!&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":315437,"PostDate":1211676798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Jen<br \/> <br \/> You might want to check this website ...there are a lot of info and reviews about Palma Real weddings.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/debsdrtravels.proboards47.com\/index.cgi?board=wedding&action=display&thread=6196&page=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Debbie's Dominican Travel Forums - Paradisus Palma Real Weddings!<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sweetnlovelymelody@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1199210162,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208085.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"melody","Id":208085,"Name":"melody","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":227,"TotalPages":23,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":220},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
