{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"148.101.194.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80069,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7439b6b6a5ef54fa1523f766d45a9859","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I understand your question perfectly, as there are so many amazing places in the Dominican Republic to get married that are not just beach locations, or gazebo.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This country has amazing mountains and rivers. &amp;nbsp;Waterfalls and attractions. &amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t imagine making a choice would be easy but think about the fact that this is your most special day and do something memorable. &amp;nbsp;Anyone can get married on a beach or a big resort, most do, but you could do so many more things with a destination wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you thought about a private villa rental for your special day? &amp;nbsp;Maybe something over-looking the ocean, all decorated up?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Maybe a tropical garden in a park or eco-lodge?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are so man options and the Dominican Republic is full of ideas. &amp;nbsp;I currently live here, so if you have questions, feel free to ask.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you all the best for your wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914176,"PostDate":1464977150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I understand your question perfectly, as there are so many amazing places in the Dominican Republic to get married that are not just beach locations, or gazebo.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This country has amazing mountains and rivers. \u00a0Waterfalls and attractions. \u00a0I can't imagine making a choice would be easy but think about the fact that this is your most special day and do something memorable. \u00a0Anyone can get married on a beach or a big resort, most do, but you could do so many more things with a destination wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you thought about a private villa rental for your special day? \u00a0Maybe something over-looking the ocean, all decorated up?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Maybe a tropical garden in a park or eco-lodge?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There are so man options and the Dominican Republic is full of ideas. \u00a0I currently live here, so if you have questions, feel free to ask.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best for your wedding.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@dominicandreamweddings.com","IpAddress":"148.255.163.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1459644124,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286637.png?_r=1459645234","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DDW","Id":286637,"Name":"DDW","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
